{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"sec\":\"\",\"mech\":\"\",\"why\":\"没有。最接近的是 S01-M12，它能提供一个过去重要、如今不在身边的人，以及仿佛从回忆中回来的亲近感，但没有确立双方曾共同拥有快乐的日子；S01-M7 和 M24 虽涉及过去珍贵的快乐或亲近时光，却没有确立具体的人。S02、S03 的候选也没有补齐这两部分，因此没有一条候选能在不额外编造设定的前提下提供所缺的完整前提。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "819107f9-89b8-40c1-8899-6463fc122f1a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T050602495282Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.235, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T05:06:50.745379+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "986074e00af722b0e64b0fe5d321edfa94ce982222427f62f2e1787e2d10e91b", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs